    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is Kz CTool ?</h2>Kz CTool is a powerfull cryptology tool. Developed for improve user's security and privacy.<br>We bored old file encryption method so we created the best one. Kz CTool has two encryption method for your files. First one is classic decyrpt/encrypt for your files (Boring, right ?). Second method is decyrpt/encrypt files for their  owner. It means doesn't matter who knows your password if solver wasn't you, your files are never be decrypted.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three encryption method.<br></li><li>Low memory usage.<br></li><li>0% Byte loss.<br></li><li>Protection with password(Classic one).<br></li><li>Kz Protection method.<br></li><li>Protection without password.</li></ul>",
